        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "The horizontal recurrence is a true loop-carried dependency and should not be unsafely SIMD-vectorized; replacing the two-row implementation plus its full copy pass with a legal in-place rolling recurrence reduces per-row memory traffic while preserving exact modular results.",
